                    {
                        "sense_id": "ceb68b7d-c385-334b-9878-b95c817c3d12",
                        "entry_id": "41b8e492-3b63-34b6-afbb-0b08fdaa0870",
                        "glosses": [
                            "The ball of the eye."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "aecc8da7-abf7-43a9-a784-dc28570c9970",
                                "sense_id": "ceb68b7d-c385-334b-9878-b95c817c3d12",
                                "text": "Goe make thy ſelfe like a Nymph o' th' Sea.\nBe ſubiect to no ſight but thine, and mine: inuisible\nTo euery eye-ball elſe: goe take this ſhape,\nAnd hither come in't: goe: hence\nWith diligence."
                            }
